            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/continuous+linear+functionals"} continuous linear functionals
            as in def.
            = succeed "," do
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CompactlySupportedDistributionsAsContinuousLinearDualsToBumpFunctions"}
            = succeed "." do
              %em smooth linear functionals
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CompactlySupportedDistributionsAreTheSmoothLinearFunctionals"}
            below), if one considers an ambient context of suitably
            = succeed "," do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/generalized+smooth+spaces"} generalized smooth spaces
